ata-tex=\"g_A\">\\(g_A\\)</span> 为 PR 集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>，元语言可推导性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。</li>\n<li>一般解释及其固定规范化参数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a> 的源语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>、目标语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 实例。</li>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma,\\pi_L\">\\(D,\\gamma,\\pi_L\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k\\)</span> 及其算术一致性句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k}\\)</span> 使用该同一系统。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的量化在外部自然数上；断言不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明一个关于所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的单一全称句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd_{L,L_A}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\left(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd_{L,L_A}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\left(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐输入中实际被调用但没有单独正确类型接口的推广：源理论可用任意有限一阶语言，目标理论仍是 PA 的算术扩张。它不是需要预先获得反身 pullback 等价的一般目标版本，因而不以该等价定理为依赖。</p>\n<p>输入档案在反身 pullback 条目的备注中明确提到第6章判据的一般源语言版本；本条据此重建其变量、前提、代码片段及一致性表示。目标为一般语言且给定反身算术解释的后续判据，应先经过 pullback 再使用本条，不能反向充当本条的前提。</p>\n<p>本轮没有原书 PDF，未将这项局部重建标记为原书逐字核验或机器证明。上述数学条件全部列于 Hypothesis 与 Assertion，Remark 不增加额外前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-general-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"